l\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Kawthar 108:2 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone].\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Kawthar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/108.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 2\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/108-2.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/108.html\">Surah Al-Kawthar</a> › Verse 2</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Kawthar 108:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَانْحَرْ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone].</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أمره الله أن يجمع بين هاتين العبادتين العظيمتين وهما الصلاة والنسك الدالتان على القرب والتواضع والافتقار وحسن الظن<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/531</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولهذا يقرن الله سبحانه بينهما كقوله: {فصل لربك وانحر}<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 2/118</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وبدأ في العيد بالصلاة ثم جعل النحر بعدها، وأخبر أن ( «من ذبح قبلها، فلا نسك له» ) تقديما لما بدأ الله به في قوله {فصل لربك وانحر}<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 2/320</cite></blockquote><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">بعض المتأولين</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «إن المراد به ضع يدك على نحرك»<cite>«الصواعق المرسلة في الرد على الجهمية والمعطلة» 2/695</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">علي</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «إنه وضع اليمين على الشمال في الصلاة تحت صدره،»<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 2/290</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s108a2\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/en/ayah/108-3.html\">Next verse (108:3)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/108-3.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Kawthar 108:3 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/108-3.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Kawthar 108:3 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Kawthar\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/108.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 3\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/108-3.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/108.html\">Surah Al-Kawthar</a> › Verse 3</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Kawthar 108:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ الْأَبْتَرُ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وفي قوله: {إن شانئك هو الأبتر} أنواع من التأكيد<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/533</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله {إن شانئك} أي مبغضك والأبتر المقطوع النسل الذي لا يولد له خير ولا عمل صالح فلا يتولد عنه خير ولا عمل صالح.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/528</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">الثاني: الإتيان بضمير الفصل الدال على قوة الإسناد والاختصاص.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/533</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s108a3\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/108-2.html\">Previous verse (108:2)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/108.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Surah Al-Kawthar — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsir of Surah Al-Kawthar — The meanings of the Qur&#x27;an in the words of Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/108.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.co